ething my choice D_x can directly control under A-FDT. I'm now weighing whether reflective consistency, as the essay suggests, pulls D_y into the picture because both nodes run the same function on symmetric inputs.\n\nI'm checking whether the payoff math holds up: with a mixture weight s on the other copy mirroring my action, cooperating beats defecting once 2s exceeds (1-s)(1+r). Since the reasoning is input-symmetric and I judge s to be high, cooperation comes out ahead, and reflective consistency points the same way, so I'll pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma where the two copies see different inputs, so the other copy's action D_y is not something my choice D_x can directly control under A-FDT. I'm now weighing whether reflective consistency, as the essay suggests, pulls D_y into the picture because both nodes run the same function on symmetric inputs.\n\nI'm checking whether the payoff math holds up: with a mixture weight s on the other copy mirroring my action, cooperating beats defecting once 2s exceeds (1-s)(1+r). Since the reasoning is input-symmetric and I judge s to be high, cooperation comes out ahead, and reflective consistency points the same way, so I'll pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9432,"completion_tokens":1068,"total_tokens":10500,"cost":0.059088,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.059088,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037728,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02136},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":544,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}